// SAFE: wake everyone; each thread re-checks its condition in a while loop
synchronized (lock) {
    queue.add(item);
    lock.notifyAll();   // all waiters re-evaluate; the correct one proceeds
}
```

Prefer notifyAll(). use `notify()` only when the protocol proves any selected waiter can proceed.

